{
  "id": "l09-hardware-explode-and-actuators",
  "order": 9,
  "title": "硬體／機構爆炸圖：元件、skin、相機與 ToF／音訊，再接到致動器參數",
  "title_en": "Hardware explode view: parts, skins, camera & ToF/audio — then drive with actuator params",
  "category": "hardware",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "minutes": 50,
  "summary": "參考 RoboParty 硬體牆爆炸動畫，在瀏覽器用 Q1 URDF 做機構分解／重組；可加 ToF／音訊元件與 skin、調相機與質量／尺寸。按「分析／分解」播放爆炸圖，再把同一組參數送進 Isaac Lab ImplicitActuatorCfg 跑站姿追蹤，看質量與 PD 如何連動。",
  "summary_en": "Inspired by the RoboParty hardware-wall explode, edit Q1 URDF parts/skins/ToF/audio/camera in the browser, play an explode animation, then drive the same config through Isaac Lab ImplicitActuatorCfg stance tracking.",
  "robots": [
    "leg",
    "wheel"
  ],
  "apis": [
    "browser URDF explode / accessories",
    "isaaclab.actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg",
    "actuator_effort_limit",
    "joint_effort_limit",
    "robot.actuators.target_command.set_position_index",
    "ArticulationCfg.spawn.scale / mass properties (lesson report)"
  ],
